WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:14.933
On Mother's Day, I want to do something for my mom.

2
00:00:14.934 --> 00:00:19.643
But what can I do for my mom?

3
00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:25.964
Ah! I will give my mom a card.

4
00:00:25.965 --> 00:00:33.333
Dear Mom, I promise to clean my room.

5
00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:38.817
I promise to help you with the dishes.

6
00:00:38.818 --> 00:00:44.269
I promise to listen when you talk to me.

7
00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:48.749
I promise to be nice to my brother.

8
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:53.570
I promise to wake up on time.

9
00:00:53.571 --> 00:00:58.955
I promise to make my own bed.

10
00:00:58.956 --> 00:01:05.546
I promise all these things. Love, Betty

11
00:01:05.547 --> 00:01:10.995
On Mother's Day, what will you do for your mom?
